WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.162
Tile Mosaic is a drafting game about decorating a palace wall. Two to four players.

2
00:00:06.862 --> 00:00:14.491
On your turn, pick a workshop or the middle, and take every tile of one colour from it. The rest slide into the centre.

3
00:00:14.641 --> 00:00:23.356
Then place them on one of your pattern lines. A line can only hold one colour, and only a colour you haven't already put in that row of the wall.

4
00:00:24.056 --> 00:00:30.871
Tiles that don't fit fall to the floor and cost you points. So taking a huge pile isn't always a good idea.

5
00:00:31.021 --> 00:00:38.491
When all the tiles are gone, each full line moves a tile onto your wall, and scores more the better it connects to its neighbours.

6
00:00:39.191 --> 00:00:47.541
The game ends when someone completes a horizontal row. Bonuses for full rows, full columns, and finishing a whole colour.

7
00:00:47.691 --> 00:00:51.562
Plan your wall so tiles link up, and the points stack up quickly.
